    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8619" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνηκουστ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be unwilling to hear, disobey,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽ ἄρα πατρὸς ἀνηκούστησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.236
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πατρὸς λόγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					40
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν νόμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.84
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῖσι στρατηγοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.14
				</span></i>
			: also abs., <i><span class="en">
				1.115
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				10.3
			</span></i>.</div>
